<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS1.SSS0.Px3" title="In 4.1 Ablations ‣ 4 Analysis ‣ Language Models that Think, Chat Better" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Impact of reward model.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS2" title="In 4 Analysis ‣ Language Models that Think, Chat Better" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.2 </span>How does RL training change model behavior?</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
