<section id="A2.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.2 </span>Comparison of our RLMT models against models trained on math</h3>

<figure id="A2.T9" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span>Comparison of RLMT models with math-trained (thinking) models.</figcaption>
<table id="A2.T9.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A2.T9.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T9.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><em id="A2.T9.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">Model</em></td>
<td id="A2.T9.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_tt"><em id="A2.T9.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">Avg.</em></td>
<td id="A2.T9.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_tt"><em id="A2.T9.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">WB</em></td>
<td id="A2.T9.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_tt"><em id="A2.T9.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">AE2</em></td>
<td id="A2.T9.2.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_tt"><em id="A2.T9.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">AH2</em></td>
<td id="A2.T9.2.1.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_tt"><em id="A2.T9.2.1.6.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">CWv3</em></td></tr>
